{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"“Noether 环”"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"Noether环"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Noether 环是满足升链性质的环. (这里的环是指交换环.)</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>若 $R$ 是 Noether 环, 则 $R[x]$ 是 Noether 环.</li>\n<li>Noether 环的商是 Noether 环.</li>\n<li>Noether 环的局部化是 Noether 环.</li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"Artin环","text":"Artin 环"}},{"Plain":"是 Noether 环.</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}